    {
      "id": "preparing-the-sarcophagus",
      "title": "Preparing the sarcophagus",
      "anchor": "Preparing_the_sarcophagus",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "Reclaiming the papyri"
        },
        {
          "type": "bring",
          "needed": [
            {
              "id": "preparing-the-sarcophagus:bring:13pf8jz",
              "html": "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Al_Kharid_flyer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Al Kharid flyer</a>",
              "text": "Al Kharid flyer"
            },
            {
              "id": "preparing-the-sarcophagus:bring:m1mim6",
              "html": "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Sq%27irkjuice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sq&#39;irkjuice</a>",
              "text": "Sq'irkjuice"
            },
            {
              "id": "preparing-the-sarcophagus:bring:qen9w8",
              "html": "<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ring_of_charos_(a)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ring of charos (a)</a>",
              "text": "Ring of charos (a)"
            }
          ],
          "recommended": []
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "These steps are only required to rebuild the mummy to 100%. They are not needed to fully complete this quest. If you need to continue <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Desert_quest_series\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Desert quest series</a> and start <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/The_Curse_of_Arrav\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">The Curse of Arrav</a>, then proceed with these steps."
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "preparing-the-sarcophagus:1u3zty4",
          "html": "The <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Scroll_of_praise\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">scroll of praise</a>:",
          "text": "The scroll of praise:",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "preparing-the-sarcophagus:1u3zty4:1l6z68a",
              "html": "Get an <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Al_Kharid_flyer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Al Kharid flyer</a> from <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Waseem_the_Leaflet_Dropper\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Waseem the Leaflet Dropper</a> north of the Al Kharid mine (at the entrance to the desert).",
              "text": "Get an Al Kharid flyer from Waseem the Leaflet Dropper north of the Al Kharid mine (at the entrance to the desert).",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": [
                {
                  "type": "step",
                  "id": "preparing-the-sarcophagus:1u3zty4:1l6z68a:15r4cya",
                  "html": "Varrock Lodestone or Archeology Journal Teleport.",
                  "text": "Varrock Lodestone or Archeology Journal Teleport.",
                  "dialogue": [],
                  "images": [],
                  "tables": [],
                  "substeps": []
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "preparing-the-sarcophagus:1u3zty4:u9vd6w",
              "html": "With your <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Al_Kharid_flyer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Al Kharid flyer</a>, talk to <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Reldo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Reldo</a> in the Varrock palace library (most northern room of the ground floor) about the pyramid. He will give you a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Scroll_of_praise\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">scroll of praise</a>.",
              "text": "With your Al Kharid flyer, talk to Reldo in the Varrock palace library (most northern room of the ground floor) about the pyramid. He will give you a scroll of praise.",
              "dialogue": [
                {
                  "when": null,
                  "options": [
                    {
                      "key": "3",
                      "text": "I'd like to talk about a pyramid."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "when": "Or",
                  "options": [
                    {
                      "key": "4",
                      "text": "I'd like to talk about a pyramid."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "step",
          "id": "preparing-the-sarcophagus:ocj818",
          "html": "The <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Copied_name_papyrus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">copied name papyrus</a> and <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Mummy%27s_name_papyrus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">mummy&#39;s name papyrus</a>:",
          "text": "The copied name papyrus and mummy's name papyrus:",
          "dialogue": [],
          "images": [],
          "tables": [],
          "substeps": [
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "preparing-the-sarcophagus:ocj818:17c2o1n",
              "html": "Play the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Sorceress%27s_Garden\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Sorceress&#39;s Garden</a> minigame and obtain a mug of any <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Sq%27irkjuice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">sq&#39;irkjuice</a>.",
              "text": "Play the Sorceress's Garden minigame and obtain a mug of any sq'irkjuice.",
              "dialogue": [],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": []
            },
            {
              "type": "step",
              "id": "preparing-the-sarcophagus:ocj818:1b3fj23",
              "html": "You need to use the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Sq%27irkjuice\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">sq&#39;irkjuice</a> on <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ali_Morrisane\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Ali Morrisane</a> at his stall. Then talk with him..",
              "text": "You need to use the sq'irkjuice on Ali Morrisane at his stall. Then talk with him..",
              "dialogue": [
                {
                  "when": null,
                  "options": [
                    {
                      "key": "3",
                      "text": "I have some questions about a tomb."
                    },
                    {
                      "key": "1",
                      "text": "I'm after ways to reunite the mummy in the pyramid."
                    },
                    {
                      "key": "4",
                      "text": "I can't think of anything sensible to ask."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ],
              "images": [],
              "tables": [],
              "substeps": [
                {
                  "type": "step",
                  "id": "preparing-the-sarcophagus:ocj818:1b3fj23:1879yen",
                  "html": "Talk to him again with a <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Ring_of_charos_(a)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ring of charos (a)</a> equipped..",
                  "text": "Talk to him again with a ring of charos (a) equipped..",
                  "dialogue": [
                    {
                      "when": null,
                      "options": [
                        {
                          "key": "3",
                          "text": "I have some questions about a tomb."
                        },
                        {
                          "key": "1",
                          "text": "I'm after ways to reunite the mummy in the pyramid."
                        },
                        {
                          "key": "4",
                          "text": "I can't think of anything sensible to ask."
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ],
                  "images": [],
                  "tables": [],
                  "substeps": []
                },
                {
                  "type": "step",
                  "id": "preparing-the-sarcophagus:ocj818:1b3fj23:1n8qtki",
                  "html": "This step will only work after talking to the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Wise_Old_Man\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Wise Old Man</a> during the <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Garden_of_Tranquillity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Garden of Tranquillity</a>, as the ring does not allow you to persuade people before this step.",
